# Процесс написания кода

Дополняет user rules и `00`–`17`.

## Scope-first

- One task = one measurable outcome; short plan if >3 files; stop when done.

## Minimal diff

- Point edits; follow **this repo** layout (`backend/`, `frontend/`).
- Erman AI / Photochka — **reference patterns**, adapt to Postilka domain.
- No unrelated refactor, renames, or extra layers without request.

## Read before write

- Narrow grep → 1–3 files same layer (`handler`, `service`, `repository`, Next page).

## Files

- New file only when no natural home; no unsolicited README/ADR.
- Tests on request or critical paths (auth, publish idempotency, presign, webhook).
- No commit/push/deploy without explicit ask.

## Anti-bloat

| Layer | Do | Don't |
|-------|-----|--------|
| Go | handler → service → repository | SQL in handlers, sync publish in HTTP |
| Next | basePath `/app`, Server Components default | second state stack |
| DB | goose migrations | manual prod schema drift |
| Jobs | worker + NATS prod | Temporal, duplicate cron |
| Providers | interface + registry | platform HTTP in React |

## Stop signals

- Missing provider API; billing/legal; >5 new files; security violations; vague scope.

